# Build context of docker/fakemedia.Dockerfile. BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore instead of
# the repository's .dockerignore (which leaves out deploy/, needed here for the demo's seeder).
# Allowlist: the Go module, the fake servers' sources, the seeder and the license; nothing else
# (no .git, no local data, no web/node_modules) is sent to the builder.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!internal
!tools
!deploy/demo/seed.sh
!LICENSE
**/.DS_Store
